        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; margin-bottom:28px;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight:900; color:#2563eb; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;">
              <span>✈️</span> POPULAR DESTINATIONS
            </div>
            <h2 style="font-size:28px; font-weight:900; margin:6px 0 0; color:#0f2a5c; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">
              Your Dream Destination Awaits
            </h2>
            <p style="font-size:13px; color:#64748b; margin-top:4px;">
              Choose your preferred country and let us guide you through the entire visa application process.
